            <ArticleTitle>[Influence of medicolegal aspects on the management of the treatment of chronic backache].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>143-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>After reviewing the different legal definitions in which low back pain is determined to represent a compensable injury, authors evoke the difficulties to prove the reality and the degree of impairment. They recommend to solve conflicting medico legal rules and disability before using other pain relief technics.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
